  "body": "Auction - Wednesday 2nd December 2026 at 2:00pm, in the Harcourts Ellerslie Auction Rooms.\r\n\r\nThe current owners have cherished this home for over 15 years, raising their children in this wonderful neighbourhood and enjoying the benefits of being in the highly regarded Macleans College Zone. Having watched their children grow up and enjoy the excellent local schooling and community, they now pass this much-loved family home on to its next fortunate owners. This is more than just a house - it is a home filled with wonderful family memories.\r\n\r\nThe home is comfortable and well maintained yet offers plenty of scope for those with vision to roll up their sleeves and give it a makeover. Bring your ideas, add your own personal touch and unlock the potential this generous 918m² property has to offer. Whether you're looking to renovate, modernise or create your dream family home, this is an opportunity worth exploring! Local shops just around the corner. You are also only minutes from Half Moon Bay Marina, tucked away in a peaceful and private setting.\r\n\r\nThe home features four well-proportioned bedrooms and two bathrooms. The master bedroom enjoys a walk-in wardrobe and ensuite, while the spacious rumpus/living area provides excellent flexibility for family entertainment, relaxation or a second living space.\r\n\r\nThe home features a well-appointed kitchen, separate dining area and a spacious lounge, providing comfortable and practical spaces for the whole family. Step outside onto the beautifully constructed deck, overlooking the BBQ area - perfect for entertaining friends and family.\r\n\r\nConvenience is another bonus, with bus stops and golf course nearby.\r\n\r\nA fantastic opportunity to secure a spacious family home in a premium school zone, with space, privacy and lifestyle all in one!\r\n\r\nDon't miss out - call us today to arrange your viewing!",
